 "intro_zh": "景区由西湖和红花湖组成，素以五湖、六桥、八景而闻名，其山川秀邃、幽胜曲折、浮洲四起、青山似黛，古色古香的亭台楼阁隐现于树木葱茏之中，景域妙在天成，有“苎萝西子”之美誉，并有“大中国西湖三十六，唯惠州足并杭州”的史载。",
 "intro_en": "West Lake (Chinese: 西湖; pinyin: Xī Hú) is a man-made recreational lake in Huicheng District of Huizhou, Guangdong, China. West Lake has a combined area of 20.91 square kilometres (8.07 sq mi), of which 3.13 square kilometres (1.21 sq mi) is covered by water. It has been designated as a National AAAAA-level Scenic Spot.",
